BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the City Treasurer is hereby appointed as the Key
Contact for the City of Cheyenne and the Authorized Signatories for the Trust are the City
Treasurer, the Mayor, and the City Clerk. The Authorized Signatories are hereby authorized by
the City of Cheyenne to direct the investment of the City's investment funds and to take all such
actions deemed necessary or desirable to carry out the activities otherwise authorized by this
Resolution, subject to the Authorized Signatories' obligation to take such actions only in the
name of and for the benefit of the City of Cheyenne as a Wyoming CLASS participant;

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the Key Contact and Authorized Signatories may be
changed by the City of Cheyenne from time-to-time by written notice to Wyoming CLASS;

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the Custodian is hereby designated as a depository
for the funds of the City of Cheyenne which shall be invested in the Trust from its general fund
and all other accounts, and the Key Contact is directed and authorized to execute any and all
depository forms and resolutions of said Custodian, and that said resolutions are adopted as
reflected thereon; and

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the application of U.S. Bank National Association to
become a depository is hereby accepted.

