16.1. Governing Law - This Indenture is executed and delivered in the state of Wyoming
and with reference to the laws thereof and the rights of all parties and the validity,
construction, and effect of every provision hereof shall be subject to and construed according
to the laws of the state of Wyoming.

16.2. Counterparts - This Indenture may be executed in several counterparts, each of
which when so executed shall be deemed to be an original, and such counterparts together
shall constitute but one and the same instrument that shall be sufficiently evidenced by any
such original counterpart.
